y="1064" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">4. Check agent permission; lock; record intent</textArea><textArea id="05-cancellation_text4" x="820" y="1256" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">5. 202 pending cancellation</textArea><textArea id="05-cancellation_text5" x="1844" y="1448" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">6. Cancel / reconcile in-flight submission</textArea><textArea id="05-cancellation_text6" x="1844" y="1640" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">7. Accepted, rejected or pending</textArea><textArea id="05-cancellation_text7" x="1844" y="2024" width="984" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">9. Submit deduplicated refund</textArea><textArea id="05-cancellation_text8" x="1332" y="2216" width="1496" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">10. Signed refund outcome callback</textArea><textArea id="05-cancellation_text9" x="1332" y="2408" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">11. Durable inbox; validate; notify customer</textArea><textArea id="05-cancellation_text10" x="308" y="2600" width="984" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">12. Read tracking and agent-action status</textArea><textArea id="05-cancellation_text11" x="64" y="3520" width="3072" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">Customer call to cancellation API -&gt; 403. A support case never automatically cancels an order. Manual provider-portal actions require an agent audit record and verified reconciliation before completion.</textArea></g></svg>